            "q": "What places do we cover in the Ladakh group trip from Srinagar?",
            "a": "You’ll start in Srinagar, then journey through [Sonamarg](https://indiatour.live/attractions/sonmarg), [Zoji La Pass](https://indiatour.live/attractions/zoji-la-pass), Kargil, Leh, Nubra Valley, [Pangong Lake](https://indiatour.live/attractions/pangong-tso), and wrap up in Leh. It's a scenic rollercoaster with snow-capped mountains, turquoise lakes, and desert valleys."
