        "faqs": [
          {
            "q": "Is this trip suitable for first-time travelers to Ladakh?",
            "a": "Yes! This itinerary is perfect for beginners—it gives you a taste of Ladakh’s major highlights like Pangong Lake and Khardung La in just 4 days, with enough time for acclimatization."
          },
          {
            "q": "What kind of weather should I expect?",
            "a": "Expect cool days and cold nights, even in summer. Temperatures can drop near the mountain passes and Pangong Lake, so carry warm clothing."
          },
          {
            "q": "Do I need a permit to visit Pangong Lake or Khardung La?",
            "a": "Yes, inner line permits are required. But don’t worry—India Tour Experiences takes care of all necessary permits for you."
          },
          {
            "q": "Will I face any altitude sickness?",
            "a": "Mild symptoms are common due to high altitude. Rest well on Day 1, stay hydrated, and avoid physical exertion or alcohol early in the trip."
          },
          {
            "q": " Is this a road trip? Are the drives safe?",
            "a": "Yes, you’ll be driven across scenic mountain roads by experienced local drivers in well-maintained vehicles. Road conditions can be rough in places, but the views are worth it."
          },
          {
            "q": "What type of accommodation is included?",
            "a": "Comfortable hotels in Leh with all basic amenities are included. Rooms are clean, cozy, and ideal for short stays."
          },
          {
            "q": "Is this trip suitable for kids or elderly travelers?",
            "a": "It depends on their fitness level and ability to handle altitude. It’s advisable to consult a doctor before booking for children under 5 or adults above 60."
          },
          {
            "q": "Will I get mobile network and internet access during the trip?",
            "a": "Leh has decent mobile and internet connectivity. However, during the Pangong day trip and mountain passes, expect limited or no signal. Carry a BSNL or Jio SIM for better coverage."
          }
        ]
