      "routeSummary": "Delhi - Leh - Nubra - Pangong - Hanle - Umlingla - Leh - Srinagar",
      "overviewText": "This **10-day Delhi to Srinagar Umling La Ladakh bike trip** is all about long-distance riding, extreme altitudes, and completing a full Himalayan circuit across the most iconic routes in Ladakh. Starting from Delhi, the journey takes you through Manali and into the high-altitude desert via the legendary Leh-Manali highway.\n\nThe ride from Manali to Leh via [Atal Tunnel](https://indiatour.live/attractions/atal-tunnel), Jispa, and [Sarchu](https://indiatour.live/attractions/sarchu) sets the tone—long open roads, dramatic landscapes, and high mountain passes. As you reach Leh, the journey continues towards Nubra Valley via [Khardung La](https://indiatour.live/attractions/khardung-la) (17,982 ft), followed by the scenic ride to Pangong Lake, where crystal-clear blue waters stretch endlessly across the mountains.\n\nThe adventure pushes further as you head towards Hanle, a remote region known for its clear skies and untouched terrain. From here, you ride to **[Umling La](https://indiatour.live/attractions/umling-la) (19,024 ft)**—one of the highest motorable roads in the world—where every kilometer feels like a true test of endurance and skill.\n\nThe return journey takes you via Kargil and the stunning Srinagar-Leh highway, crossing Zoji La and passing through Sonmarg, before concluding in Srinagar completing a full circuit across Ladakh’s most scenic and diverse landscapes.\n\nLong, intense, and unforgettable this trip is for riders who want to experience [Ladakh from Delhi to Srinagar](https://indiatour.live/tours/delhi-to-delhi-with-umling-la-tso-moriri-ladakh-bike-trip) in its most complete and thrilling form.\n\n\n### **Delhi to Srinagar Umling La Ladakh Bike Trip Route:**\n\nDelhi - Manali - Sarchu - Leh - Khardungla - Nubra - Pangong - Hanle - Umling La - Leh - [Kargil](https://indiatour.live/attractions/kargil) - Srinagar\n\n\n### **Why You Should Opt for This Delhi to Srinagar Umling La [Ladakh Bike Trip](https://indiatour.live/tours/delhi-to-delhi-with-umling-la-tso-moriri-ladakh-bike-trip)**\n\nIf you’re looking for a Ladakh bike trip that combines extreme adventure with a complete Himalayan circuit, this is it! Over 10 days, you’ll ride across diverse terrains, iconic routes, and remote high-altitude regions.\n\n**1. Complete Delhi to Srinagar Circuit:** Start from Delhi and finish in Srinagar, covering both Leh-Manali and Srinagar-Leh highways in one epic journey.\n\n**2. Conquer Umling La – One of the Highest Roads in the World:** Ride to Umling La (19,024 ft), a true high-altitude challenge and one of the most sought-after biking experiences in Ladakh.\n\n**3. Ride Through India’s Most Iconic Routes:** From Atal Tunnel and Sarchu to [Zoji La](https://indiatour.live/attractions/zoji-la-pass) and [Sonmarg](https://indiatour.live/attractions/sonmarg), this trip covers legendary roads every rider dreams of.\n\n**4. Explore Ladakh’s Top Highlights:** Experience Nubra Valley, [Pangong Lake](https://indiatour.live/attractions/pangong-tso), and Hanle—each offering completely different landscapes and experiences.\n\n**5. Experience Changing Landscapes Across the Journey:** From lush valleys of Manali to high-altitude deserts of Ladakh and green landscapes of Kashmir, every day feels different.\n\n**6. A Perfect Mix of Scenic & Extreme Riding:** This trip balances smooth highways, rugged terrain, high passes, and remote routes for a complete adventure.\n\nThis [Leh Ladakh bike trip](https://indiatour.live/tours/umling-la-hanle-ladakh-bike-trip-from-delhi) isn’t just about riding it’s about completing one of the most iconic journeys across the Himalayas. If you want a full-fledged adventure from Delhi to Srinagar, this is the ultimate ride.",
